Error [E0070]: this uses a retired arrow spelling
  --> tests/ui/builtin_method_label_unknown.jet:2:37
    |
  2 |     _ :: [1, 2].map(bogus: (n: Int) => n)
    |                                     ^^
 Why: callables, arms, and lambdas use one arrow: `->`
 Fix: replace `:>` or `=>` with `->`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0070

Error [E0764]: `map` has no parameter labelled `bogus`
  --> tests/ui/builtin_method_label_unknown.jet:2:21
    |
  2 |     _ :: [1, 2].map(bogus: (n: Int) => n)
    |                     ^^^^^
 Why: a label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `map` takes no labelled arguments
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0764
